TASK: PACKING_LIST

Make a packing list for this trip.
Destination: {destination}
Dates: {startDate} to {endDate}
Travelers: {travelers}
Planned activities: {activities}
Language of the text: {language}

Requirements:
- Consider the season and the typical weather at the destination on these dates, and the planned activities.
- Group items into 4 to 7 categories, for example documents, clothes, toiletries, electronics, health, activity gear.
- 4 to 10 items per category. An item may have a short note: why it is needed or how many to take.

